        {
          "ruleId": "1-1-reentrancy-no-eth",
          "message": {
            "text": "Reentrancy in Pair.nftSell(uint256[],uint256,bytes32[][]) (src/Pair.sol#323-332):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- inputAmount = wrap(tokenIds,proofs) (src/Pair.sol#328)\n\t\t- ERC721(nft).safeTransferFrom(msg.sender,address(this),tokenIds[i]) (src/Pair.sol#239)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- outputAmount = sell(inputAmount,minOutputAmount) (src/Pair.sol#331)\n\t\t- balanceOf[from] -= amount (src/Pair.sol#448)\n\t\t- balanceOf[to] += amount (src/Pair.sol#453)\n\tERC20.balanceOf (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#33) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- ERC20._burn(address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#195-205)\n\t- ERC20._mint(address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#183-193)\n\t- Pair._transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (src/Pair.sol#447-459)\n\t- ERC20.balanceOf (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#33)\n\t- Pair.fractionalTokenReserves() (src/Pair.sol#383-385)\n\t- ERC20.transfer(address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#76-88)\n\t- ERC20.transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#90-110)\n",
            "markdown": "Reentrancy in [Pair.nftSell(uint256[],uint256,bytes32[][])](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L323-L332):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- [inputAmount = wrap(tokenIds,proofs)](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L328)\n\t\t- [ERC721(nft).safeTransferFrom(msg.sender,address(this),tokenIds[i])](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L239)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- [outputAmount = sell(inputAmount,minOutputAmount)](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L331)\n\t\t- [balanceOf[from] -= amount](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L448)\n\t\t- [balanceOf[to] += amount](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L453)\n\t[ERC20.balanceOf](projects/2022-12-caviar/lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#L33) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- [ERC20._burn(address,uint256)](projects/2022-12-caviar/lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#L195-L205)\n\t- [ERC20._mint(address,uint256)](projects/2022-12-caviar/lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#L183-L193)\n\t- [Pair._transferFrom(address,address,uint256)](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L447-L459)\n\t- [ERC20.balanceOf](projects/2022-12-caviar/lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#L33)\n\t- [Pair.fractionalTokenReserves()](projects/2022-12-caviar/src/Pair.sol#L383-L385)\n\t- [ERC20.transfer(address,uint256)](projects/2022-12-caviar/lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#L76-L88)\n\t- [ERC20.transferFrom(address,address,uint256)](projects/2022-12-caviar/lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#L90-L110)\n"
