          "ruleId": "1-2-second-reentrancy-no-eth",
          "message": {
            "text": "Reentrancy in Pair.nftAdd(uint256,uint256[],uint256,bytes32[][]) (src/Pair.sol#275-286):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- fractionalTokenAmount = wrap(tokenIds,proofs) (src/Pair.sol#282)\n\t\t- ERC721(nft).safeTransferFrom(msg.sender,address(this),tokenIds[i]) (src/Pair.sol#239)\n\t- lpTokenAmount = add(baseTokenAmount,fractionalTokenAmount,minLpTokenAmount) (src/Pair.sol#285)\n\t\t- lpToken.mint(msg.sender,lpTokenAmount) (src/Pair.sol#90)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- lpTokenAmount = add(baseTokenAmount,fractionalTokenAmount,minLpTokenAmount) (src/Pair.sol#285)\n\t\t- balanceOf[from] -= amount (src/Pair.sol#448)\n\t\t- balanceOf[to] += amount (src/Pair.sol#453)\n\tERC20.balanceOf (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#33) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- ERC20._burn(address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#195-205)\n\t- ERC20._mint(address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#183-193)\n\t- Pair._transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (src/Pair.sol#447-459)\n\t- ERC20.balanceOf (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#33)\n\t- Pair.fractionalTokenReserves() (src/Pair.sol#383-385)\n\t- ERC20.transfer(address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#76-88)\n\t- ERC20.transferFrom(address,address,uint256) (lib/solmate/src/tokens/ERC20.sol#90-110)\n",
